# CellularAutomata

CellularAutomata is a Java application created Swing for running different cellular automata
simulations, including [Elementary Cellular Automaton](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elementary_cellular_automaton) and [Conway's game of Life](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Conway's_Game_of_Life)

## Features

- Grid for viewing the state of the simulation
- Control panel for various user input
	- Start, Stop, Step
	- Randomise grid
	- Set simulation rules
	- etc.

## Requirements

Java

## How to Use

1. Clone the repository
1. Open the project in any Java IDE
1. Run the project

